    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d286">

                <pb facs="0418" n="302" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg302"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 839.51/1493.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Sullivan to the Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Extract.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Santo Domingo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-02-09T09:00:00-04:40">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 9, 1915—9 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Dominican Congress has refused twice to ratify financial expert’s appointment.
                    Politicians show irritation at increasing difficulty in squandering public funds
                    because of financial expert’s control.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sullivan</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
